6.2 To the extent a third-party license conflicts with this Agreement, the
    third-party license governs with respect to that third-party material.
    Nothing in this Agreement is intended, or shall be construed, to restrict or
    alter any right that a third-party license lawfully confers on its users.

Article 7. Relationship to Mojang / Microsoft

7.1 The Software is an unofficial third-party mod for Minecraft. It is not
    affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by, or endorsed by Mojang Studios,
